  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là nhiệt độ của bình tại thời điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có nhiệt độ của bình tại thời điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math> là \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br> \t\t\n\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\t\t\n\t\tDo đó, nhiệt độ của bình tại thời điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> phút kể từ khi truyền nhiệt là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>28</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mtext><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
